# FM Landings

When the user says to familiarize yourself with the project (or this is a fresh session), **read `ONBOARDING.md` first**, then Tier 1 files listed there (`AGENTS.md`, `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAYBOOK.md`, etc.). Confirm how you will work before large implementations.

Hard rules:
- Figma = structure only; TZ/brief = content only
- Inventory-only landing blocks (`design-system/block-inventory.json`)
- Ship via push to main → production `fm.growth-agent.org/{slug}/`
- Full process + anti-patterns: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAYBOOK.md`
- Social URLs from live fusionmarkets.com; chrome icons from Figma SVGs under `public/brand/`
- Do not edit `design-system/generated/*`
- Do not invent answers in `docs/OPEN_QUESTIONS.md`
